# BL-32: SHA-256 of the bootloader image per BL_VERSION_NUMBER (bootloader/include/bl_config.h).
# Reference preset evalboard-s32k144-demo (project evalboard_s32k144_demo), bootloader.hex of the RelWithDebInfo build.
# Hashed: flash content from the first to the last written address, gaps 0xFF (= objcopy -O binary --gap-fill 0xff);
# no debug information, no paths. Checked by tools/elfcheck blversion (tools/test entry bl-image-version).
# Format: <version> <sha256> <arm-none-eabi-gcc -dumpversion>. Append only, never rewrite an entry: a changed image
# needs a new BL_VERSION_NUMBER.
#
# 0.3.4: the image in the field (Eval Board, flashed 2026-09-22, J-Link read 2026-09-25 and 2026-09-29), reproduced
#        byte for byte from 0.3.4 sources with the sorted library members of BL-32. The unsorted xPack build of the
#        same sources (dev until BL-32) was c52211dbce745d8ab1116f2ef795f31dfdd6afcc5d9a8a8abad76b4599f09e07.
